{"t":"2026-05-20T19:58:58.343Z","event":"sdk_msg","msg":{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CwUmHYq2pJ8gXdhATZkeWn","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→-- Copyright 2026 VibeSpace LLC\n     2→-- Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0\n     3→\n     4→-- VibeSpace Talent Agent — Auth Schema\n     5→\n     6→-- ─── Users ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n     7→\n     8→CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS users (\n     9→    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\n    10→    email VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\n    11→    name VARCHAR(255),\n    12→    is_active BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE,\n    13→    is_onboarded BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\n    14→    candidate_id UUID UNIQUE REFERENCES candidates(id) ON DELETE SET NULL,\n    15→    last_login_at TIMESTAMPTZ,\n    16→    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW(),\n    17→    updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()\n    18→);\n    19→\n    20→CREATE TRIGGER update_users_updated_at\n    21→    BEFORE UPDATE ON users\n    22→    FOR EACH ROW EXECUTE FUNCTION update_updated_at_column();\n    23→\n    24→CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_users_email ON users(email);\n    25→CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_users_candidate ON users(candidate_id);\n    26→\n    27→-- ─── Magic Links ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    28→\n    29→CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS magic_links (\n    30→    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\n    31→    user_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n    32→    token VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\n    33→    is_used BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\n    34→    expires_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,\n    35→    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()\n    36→);\n    37→\n    38→CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_magic_links_token ON magic_links(token);\n    39→CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_magic_links_user ON magic_links(user_id);\n    40→CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_magic_links_expires ON magic_links(expires_at);\n    41→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"922c085c-e35c-4179-9c95-d428c008504e","uuid":"060c69f7-d008-4365-9067-3d6bb6201858","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/spy/mfautomation/repos/creation-station/reverse-search/backend/migrations/003_auth.sql","content":"-- Copyright 2026 VibeSpace LLC\n-- Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0\n\n-- VibeSpace Talent Agent — Auth Schema\n\n-- ─── Users ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS users (\n    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\n    email VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\n    name VARCHAR(255),\n    is_active BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE,\n    is_onboarded BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\n    candidate_id UUID UNIQUE REFERENCES candidates(id) ON DELETE SET NULL,\n    last_login_at TIMESTAMPTZ,\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW(),\n    updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()\n);\n\nCREATE TRIGGER update_users_updated_at\n    BEFORE UPDATE ON users\n    FOR EACH ROW EXECUTE FUNCTION update_updated_at_column();\n\nCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_users_email ON users(email);\nCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_users_candidate ON users(candidate_id);\n\n-- ─── Magic Links ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS magic_links (\n    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\n    user_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n    token VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\n    is_used BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\n    expires_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()\n);\n\nCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_magic_links_token ON magic_links(token);\nCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_magic_links_user ON magic_links(user_id);\nCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_magic_links_expires ON magic_links(expires_at);\n","numLines":41,"startLine":1,"totalLines":41}}}}
{"t":"2026-05-20T19:59:07.772Z","event":"sdk_msg","msg":{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01Pdb7BQLoPJ7Mr9X5FrTQjR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have a clear picture. The auth module already exists and is fairly complete. Let me verify what's missing against the HYPHA-AUTH acceptance criteria:\n\n**Analysis of existing `backend/api/auth.py`:**\n\n✅ Magic link generation (48-byte token)\n✅ JWT issuance (HS256, 7d expiry)\n✅ `/auth/request-link`, `/auth/verify`, `/auth/me` endpoints\n✅ `get_current_user` dependency\n✅ Dev-mode magic link return in response\n✅ Single-use enforcement\n✅ Expiry checking\n✅ User creation on first request\n✅ Last-login tracking\n✅ structlog logging\n\n**Gaps to address:**\n1. **Resend integration** for production email — the TODO comment mentions this, and the HYPHA says \"out of scope for prod\" but I need to wire up Resend (since it's in my scope)\n2. **PII redaction in logs** — currently logging raw email; needs redaction per NUTRIENTS.md H.4\n3. Requirements.txt needs `resend` package\n4. Config needs `resend_api_key`\n5. `.env.example` needs the Resend env var\n\nLet me implement the Resend integration and PII redaction:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1227,"cache_read_input_tokens":52864,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1227,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"922c085c-e35c-4179-9c95-d428c008504e","uuid":"3b66997c-69d4-41eb-b2d9-7e4edc4b6c65"}}
